WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.980
Episode 60

00:00.000 --> 00:02.980
<b>Land of Inhuman 
Demons (Part 3)</b>

00:04.450 --> 00:09.820
<i>The day I won the tournament competition, 
Dad never even came to pick me up.</i>

00:11.040 --> 00:15.770
<i>To me, karate was at the heart 
of my journey to justice.</i>

00:15.770 --> 00:20.570
<i>But to my dad, it was just a way to train 
my body so that I could be more elegant.</i>

00:20.850 --> 00:24.460
Why are you so crude and unrefined?

00:24.860 --> 00:26.250
Learn from your sister!

00:26.250 --> 00:30.050
<i>Said older sister died when I was eight.</i>

00:30.360 --> 00:33.380
Your sister would have had 
no trouble doing this.

00:33.380 --> 00:34.300
<i>I can't.</i>

00:34.830 --> 00:38.110
<i>No one can best the perfection of the dead.</i>

00:39.580 --> 00:41.560
You're a failure!

00:46.270 --> 00:47.560
Where am I?

00:48.110 --> 00:51.840
I was attacked on the car, and...

00:51.840 --> 00:53.330
You're awake.

00:53.330 --> 00:54.390
Bra-chan.

00:54.390 --> 00:55.600
Be careful.

00:55.990 --> 00:58.120
Make the wrong move, and you'll fall.

01:04.380 --> 01:07.700
What impudence from my compatriot in black.

01:08.060 --> 01:11.210
He intends to keep me alive as bait.

01:15.530 --> 01:18.370
He has displayed me here, 
high on a tower,

01:18.370 --> 01:21.470
so that I may lure the Detective Agency 
members to their deaths.

01:23.040 --> 01:24.680
Really?

01:25.200 --> 01:27.100
Is that all it is?

01:28.520 --> 01:33.090
Why did he keep me alive, too, then?

03:03.180 --> 03:04.630
<i>What do we do?</i>

03:05.400 --> 03:10.130
<i>We can't manipulate gravity in order 
to escape the way Nakahara Chuuya can.</i>

03:10.440 --> 03:12.370
<i>And this room is small.</i>

03:12.370 --> 03:14.420
<i>It'll be filled with water in an instant.</i>

03:14.420 --> 03:16.020
<i>We need to think!</i>

03:20.700 --> 03:21.890
Get down!

03:24.640 --> 03:25.820
<i>What the...</i>

03:25.820 --> 03:26.980
<i>I can't breathe.</i>

03:29.800 --> 03:31.420
<i>The surface is on fire?!</i>

03:31.970 --> 03:35.840
<i>The walls were painted with 
transparent, flammable fuel.</i>

03:36.580 --> 03:38.870
<i>This must be one of Fyodor's schemes!</i>

03:39.360 --> 03:41.340
<i>If we raise our heads, we'll burn to death.</i>

03:41.340 --> 03:42.140
<i>But...</i>

03:43.570 --> 03:44.660
<i>My breath...</i>

03:57.510 --> 04:00.190
<i>It's not powerful enough underwater.</i>

04:02.250 --> 04:04.760
<i>Shit! I'm out of breath!</i>

04:06.100 --> 04:07.500
<i>The fire went out.</i>

04:07.500 --> 04:08.520
<i>I see!</i>

04:08.520 --> 04:10.310
<i>The fuel got used up.</i>

04:11.310 --> 04:12.690
<i>We're saved!</i>

04:20.510 --> 04:21.690
<i>Dazai...</i>

04:22.090 --> 04:23.140
<i>It can't be...</i>

04:24.100 --> 04:25.240
<i>Shit...</i>

04:25.240 --> 04:26.350
<i>I can't breathe.</i>

04:33.730 --> 04:34.830
<i>No.</i>

04:38.460 --> 04:42.820
<i>It was only later that I realized 
that a flame in a confined room</i>

04:42.820 --> 04:44.850
<i>will quickly consume
 all the available oxygen.</i>

04:45.510 --> 04:49.510
<i>Should we try to breathe that air, 
our blood would instead be robbed of oxygen,</i>

04:49.510 --> 04:51.460
<i>and we would be dead 
after a single breath.</i>

04:51.990 --> 04:54.450
<i>I would have died had 
Dazai not stopped me.</i>

04:54.840 --> 04:59.500
<i>But to be unable to raise our heads means 
we're left with no choice but to drown.</i>

05:00.770 --> 05:02.900
<i>Why is he making that face?</i>

05:15.840 --> 05:17.360
<i>There's a crack in the door!</i>

05:21.460 --> 05:23.290
<i>I'm starting to get it.</i>

05:25.260 --> 05:29.730
<i>Dazai destroyed the tensile wire
 that controls the door.</i>

05:30.620 --> 05:35.430
<i>Open!</i>

05:45.930 --> 05:47.270
I'm alive...

05:48.350 --> 05:49.030
Dazai!

05:53.340 --> 05:56.990
<i>Exception detected in flooding protocol.</i>

05:56.990 --> 06:00.470
<i>Commencing drop impact sequence.</i>

06:04.750 --> 06:05.800
<i>This is bad!</i>

06:05.800 --> 06:07.800
<i>We need to escape before it accelerates!</i>

06:08.050 --> 06:08.790
<i>Or we're dead!</i>

06:11.150 --> 06:13.090
I did make a promise...

06:13.530 --> 06:15.230
That I'd get you out alive.

06:19.140 --> 06:20.770
It's up to you now.

06:25.970 --> 06:27.510
<i>I don't know.</i>

06:27.510 --> 06:29.190
<i>I don't know what's correct.</i>

06:29.190 --> 06:31.950
<i>I'm so conflicted, my body feels 
like it's being torn apart.</i>

06:33.080 --> 06:37.370
I'll tell you the true goal
 of the Decay of Angels.

06:37.680 --> 06:39.760
<i>I want the answer.</i>

06:39.760 --> 06:40.820
<i>Somebody.</i>

06:41.270 --> 06:42.350
<i>Dazai-san!</i>

06:42.850 --> 06:45.170
You're giving up already?

06:45.650 --> 06:46.880
Don't be clingy.

06:46.880 --> 06:49.050
Find a way with the strength you have now.

06:58.060 --> 06:59.040
That's...

06:59.770 --> 07:02.270
The girl Rampo-san said to find!

07:02.670 --> 07:04.030
I'll help her now!

07:04.350 --> 07:05.680
Someone's coming.

07:06.760 --> 07:07.780
Don't come!

07:08.360 --> 07:09.870
It's a trap!

07:13.800 --> 07:14.960
I can't.

07:15.860 --> 07:16.900
I can't.

07:16.900 --> 07:18.240
I can't. I can't.

07:19.620 --> 07:21.090
It's up to you now.

07:21.350 --> 07:22.630
Up to me?

07:22.630 --> 07:23.640
What is?

07:24.140 --> 07:26.970
What could a pedestrian man like me do?

07:27.460 --> 07:28.820
I'll run.

07:29.350 --> 07:32.740
This was never my fight anyway.

07:37.070 --> 07:38.100
What's this?

07:42.850 --> 07:44.120
Russian?

07:44.690 --> 07:46.230
What does it mean?

07:50.720 --> 07:52.180
Akutagawa! It's me!

07:52.180 --> 07:53.080
Don't you recognize me?

07:56.990 --> 08:00.210
If I can't run, I'll step forward!

08:09.510 --> 08:11.410
His black cloth isn't protecting him.

08:17.620 --> 08:18.770
His broken arm...

08:19.060 --> 08:21.020
Vampiric abilities!

08:21.020 --> 08:23.910
He doesn't need to defend himself 
if he can regenerate.

08:24.220 --> 08:26.600
This won't end unless I kill him.

08:26.980 --> 08:28.490
Stop, Akutagawa!

08:28.490 --> 08:31.010
I still haven't had your answer!

08:32.500 --> 08:34.450
Why did you...

08:35.610 --> 08:36.920
You fool!

08:36.920 --> 08:38.000
Get out of here!

08:38.380 --> 08:40.730
Why did you save me?

08:42.690 --> 08:45.530
O-Ow...

08:45.530 --> 08:47.070
Damn it.

08:47.070 --> 08:48.790
My leg's broken.

08:50.180 --> 08:52.230
Come on, man. Please.

08:52.770 --> 08:54.600
It's starting to hurt.

08:55.030 --> 08:56.600
<i>Give me peace.</i>

08:59.300 --> 09:00.600
Gladly.

09:01.240 --> 09:03.190
Can you hear me, Chuuya-san?

09:03.190 --> 09:05.580
Your target's on the fourth floor.

09:05.580 --> 09:06.860
Kill him.

09:15.490 --> 09:18.040
Withdraw your order to attack Dazai.

09:18.630 --> 09:19.810
The next one hits you.

09:20.200 --> 09:22.090
I'm amused.

09:22.090 --> 09:25.330
Sigma-san, I'd assumed you'd escaped.

09:25.680 --> 09:28.970
I'll touch you and learn of 
your plans at the airport.

09:28.970 --> 09:30.980
That's what I'd promised Dazai.

09:31.380 --> 09:33.060
I see.

09:33.060 --> 09:35.190
I'd expect no less from Dazai-kun.

09:35.190 --> 09:38.080
It only took him ten-odd 
minutes to manipulate you.

09:38.080 --> 09:38.900
What?

09:38.900 --> 09:42.390
You aren't the kind of man who 
would normally take such risks.

09:42.660 --> 09:46.100
In observing Dazai-kun, 
you were forced into a realization...

09:46.100 --> 09:50.890
What you really need isn't a place 
you call "home," but <i>trust</i>.

09:51.320 --> 09:53.560
In other words, you had a thought...

09:54.130 --> 09:56.610
That you want to become a 
Detective Agency member.

09:57.430 --> 10:00.200
We have to save the 
Detective Agency at the airport.

10:01.050 --> 10:02.690
It's up to you now.

10:03.490 --> 10:05.040
Am I mistaken?

10:06.250 --> 10:09.010
You may be right that I'm being manipulated.

10:09.530 --> 10:12.130
But Dazai paid the price for that.

10:12.560 --> 10:16.450
When a patron makes a raise, 
a casino must respond in kind!

10:17.570 --> 10:20.520
In fact, you were the one 
who tried to manipulate me.

10:20.920 --> 10:25.020
You tried to cast doubt on Dazai 
and make me lower my gun.

10:25.830 --> 10:28.820
Dazai wins control over me.

10:29.510 --> 10:31.360
Is that so?

10:31.360 --> 10:34.390
I'm going to touch you 
and read your memories.

10:34.390 --> 10:36.230
But first, tell me...

10:37.600 --> 10:39.650
What is your special ability?

10:40.050 --> 10:43.730
Rather, what <i>are</i> you?

10:46.260 --> 10:49.720
<i>Unlock the One Order within five minutes.</i>

10:49.720 --> 10:53.290
<i>Otherwise, I will have the vampires
attack the world all at once.</i>

10:54.030 --> 10:56.020
Bra-chan, did you hear that?

10:56.320 --> 10:58.700
They're attacking the world in five minutes!

10:59.930 --> 11:01.810
It won't open!

11:01.810 --> 11:03.300
What do you think he means?

11:05.580 --> 11:06.900
Wait...

11:06.900 --> 11:07.880
You knew?

11:08.120 --> 11:15.260
Fukuchi wielded the holy sword and sent a 
command to the vampires while you were asleep.

11:16.150 --> 11:19.870
Before long, the world will become hell.

11:19.870 --> 11:21.110
No...

11:21.110 --> 11:23.840
You're the king of demons, 
destroyer of worlds, aren't you?

11:23.840 --> 11:26.590
I don't care if you're 
all head or part sword.

11:26.590 --> 11:29.500
Use your evil "bwahaha" power! Do something!

11:29.770 --> 11:31.350
There has to be something, isn't there?

11:31.350 --> 11:33.570
Some power you can use 
even in this situation!

11:33.810 --> 11:38.630
My authority over the useful parts of my 
abilities was taken by the holy sword.

11:38.630 --> 11:40.840
What remains...

11:41.230 --> 11:42.850
Is my aversion sunlight.

11:43.510 --> 11:46.340
My aversion to silver 
and the scent of roses.

11:46.920 --> 11:48.790
Also, garlic sucks.

11:49.150 --> 11:50.530
And...

11:50.530 --> 11:53.980
I can't see myself in the mirror, I guess.

11:55.060 --> 11:56.850
I mean...

11:56.850 --> 11:58.470
I think that's fine.

11:58.470 --> 12:00.180
What humiliation.

12:00.780 --> 12:04.140
I guess we need to get that sword out, then.

12:04.140 --> 12:05.760
It's not possible.

12:05.760 --> 12:09.480
The roots of the holy sword 
are too sturdy for you.

12:09.870 --> 12:16.220
Still, sitting still for the next 
five minutes isn't my style.

12:17.670 --> 12:19.750
Bra-chan, sorry about this.

12:22.360 --> 12:25.420
Sorry, but I have to help everyone!

12:25.700 --> 12:28.350
Fine... Do it.

12:28.350 --> 12:32.030
But you said you have no interest 
in what happens to the world.

12:32.030 --> 12:33.980
I don't.

12:35.290 --> 12:38.980
Not in the world.

12:41.480 --> 12:42.870
Father.

12:47.450 --> 12:51.000
<b>Just what are you?</b>

12:47.530 --> 12:50.660
Just what are you?

12:51.630 --> 12:53.100
Your special ability is unknown.

12:53.100 --> 12:55.070
Your origins are unknown.

12:55.070 --> 12:57.660
You're a void upon this world.

12:58.780 --> 13:01.010
I found a note written in Russian.

13:01.010 --> 13:03.180
Were you the one who wrote it?

13:04.110 --> 13:05.660
"Help me"?

13:06.510 --> 13:08.280
Help...

13:18.030 --> 13:18.920
Help me...

13:18.920 --> 13:20.070
Help me...

13:20.070 --> 13:21.780
Help me!

13:29.950 --> 13:31.650
Open your eyes, Akutagawa!

13:31.650 --> 13:32.650
You're in there, aren't you?

13:33.160 --> 13:34.610
I can tell!

13:34.610 --> 13:37.830
You didn't kill her!

13:38.570 --> 13:40.910
Bram would have been all 
the bait you needed.

13:41.300 --> 13:43.680
But you spared the girl!

13:44.230 --> 13:46.080
I know why, too.

13:46.080 --> 13:50.480
It's because you promised that you wouldn't 
kill anyone for the next six months!

13:50.960 --> 13:53.680
Now's not the time for 
us to kill each other!

14:01.620 --> 14:04.430
I got you, Akutagawa!

14:07.920 --> 14:09.710
<i>His black cloth isn't protecting him.</i>

14:09.710 --> 14:11.450
<i>So if I hit him...</i>

14:39.060 --> 14:40.360
Tell me...

14:40.360 --> 14:41.440
What year is it?

14:44.350 --> 14:46.440
Open your eyes, Akutagawa!

14:47.430 --> 14:49.360
You want to become strong, don't you?

14:52.510 --> 14:53.870
Strong...

14:54.090 --> 14:55.180
That's right!

14:55.180 --> 14:56.740
Don't lose to yourself!

15:06.290 --> 15:07.620
Listen to me...

15:07.620 --> 15:09.000
He's a demon!

15:09.300 --> 15:12.700
He's evil texts turned flesh.

15:12.700 --> 15:14.570
I can't stop him.

15:14.570 --> 15:15.700
Don't move!

15:16.120 --> 15:17.900
But there is hope.

15:18.570 --> 15:19.350
You.

15:19.850 --> 15:22.160
Sword Kladenets...

15:22.160 --> 15:24.940
It looks like a normal weapon on the outside,

15:24.940 --> 15:28.290
but it's made of ability-imbued 
silver like the holy sword.

15:29.260 --> 15:32.710
It's the only weapon that can kill 
the special ability that is me.

15:33.080 --> 15:36.750
He's a demon born from 
the weakness of my heart.

15:37.360 --> 15:40.910
I was so weak that I was taken 
over by my own special ability.

15:41.210 --> 15:42.640
<i>A split personality?</i>

15:43.270 --> 15:45.680
<i>Is that Fyodor's ability?</i>

15:52.270 --> 15:53.740
Just kidding.

15:54.610 --> 15:59.830
Split personalities are such a stale trope, 
but I figured you'd fall for it.

16:03.530 --> 16:04.730
Pardon me.

16:04.730 --> 16:07.810
I had to make sure you were committed.

16:07.810 --> 16:09.730
But since you clearly are...

16:09.730 --> 16:12.520
Now, please go ahead and 
read what you'd like.

16:14.520 --> 16:18.210
I don't mind having you touch me 
and take any information you wish.

16:18.780 --> 16:22.120
If you have the courage, that is.

16:23.130 --> 16:26.040
<i>Chairperson, what is your answer?</i>

16:26.600 --> 16:29.610
A vote was passed by majority.

16:29.610 --> 16:32.760
I'll tell you how to open the One Order.

16:33.500 --> 16:36.980
<i>I guess I'll have to throw out the 
Fukuchi fan merch I have at home.</i>

16:37.440 --> 16:38.780
Please do.

16:51.020 --> 16:52.910
That can't be...

16:52.910 --> 16:54.860
The light of the end times.

16:55.520 --> 16:59.250
The world will burn within 
a few dozen seconds.

17:00.120 --> 17:01.610
Now, go ahead.

17:01.610 --> 17:03.000
Touch me.

17:04.740 --> 17:09.370
<i>This might be the last bet I ever make.</i>

17:09.980 --> 17:11.580
What do you want to know?

17:12.590 --> 17:14.580
All of your secrets.

17:19.310 --> 17:21.590
It's the end of the world.

17:21.790 --> 17:23.050
Not yet.

17:23.050 --> 17:24.390
What are you doing?

17:24.390 --> 17:26.850
I'm going to look for something 
to help pull the sword out!

17:28.220 --> 17:30.980
Is there anything I can use?

17:32.150 --> 17:35.290
That's the hole he used to move us here.

17:38.040 --> 17:39.150
That's it!

17:39.150 --> 17:40.660
That should do the trick!

17:43.300 --> 17:45.450
Girl, what do you think you're doing?

17:46.950 --> 17:50.470
I'm throwing this table down.

17:51.440 --> 17:55.420
It's at least 30 kilos.

17:56.030 --> 18:00.390
I just need to tie the sword to it
 and throw it off the edge.

18:00.390 --> 18:02.900
The weight should pull the sword out!

18:10.890 --> 18:14.250
<i>What is this torrent of light?</i>

18:15.280 --> 18:16.430
<i>It's...</i>

18:16.890 --> 18:18.370
<i>information?</i>

18:30.450 --> 18:33.810
I've imagined this situation so many times.

18:34.260 --> 18:38.200
Though, in my imagination, 
we were on opposite sides.

18:38.960 --> 18:40.120
What's wrong?

18:40.120 --> 18:41.620
Come, Chuuya.

18:41.620 --> 18:45.150
Entertain me with your flimsy punch!

18:48.040 --> 18:49.050
Stop.

18:51.290 --> 18:52.660
It's a provocation.

18:53.200 --> 18:57.100
He's trying to release you from your 
vampiric state by having you touch him.

18:57.380 --> 18:59.070
Take him out from afar.

18:59.070 --> 19:00.000
Damn.

19:02.360 --> 19:04.270
Bitch! That hurt!

19:05.300 --> 19:08.240
Where do you think you're 
aiming? You suck at this!

19:09.130 --> 19:12.240
<i>Now you won't miss.</i>

19:14.180 --> 19:15.650
This is just the worst.

19:15.650 --> 19:18.260
I'm in pain. I lose to Fyodor.

19:18.260 --> 19:21.640
And to top it off, it's Chuuya 
that's about to kill me.

19:21.980 --> 19:25.030
You look utterly defeated.

19:25.030 --> 19:26.420
<i>Who knows?</i>

19:26.420 --> 19:30.360
<i>I might say something absolutely 
profound and moving,</i>

19:30.360 --> 19:33.970
<i>and Chuuya might come back to his senses 
by the miraculous power of friendship.</i>

19:34.310 --> 19:36.740
<i>Give it a try, then.</i>

19:37.890 --> 19:39.240
Chuuya...

19:39.240 --> 19:40.430
Wake up.

19:41.560 --> 19:44.920
Our fate isn't to be done here.

19:44.920 --> 19:46.360
For our—

20:26.360 --> 20:29.920
All units, attack!

20:35.170 --> 20:36.010
No!

20:36.450 --> 20:38.280
This isn't what you promised!

20:38.860 --> 20:44.000
Nuclear silos one through eight, 
begin launching sequence.

20:47.160 --> 20:50.430
Terminal guidance systems fully operational.

20:50.430 --> 20:52.140
Thirty seconds to launch.

20:57.260 --> 21:00.910
<i>Armored forces approaching 
from southeast of the border!</i>

21:00.910 --> 21:02.750
<i>IFF failure!</i>

21:02.750 --> 21:04.350
<i>Requesting immediate backup!</i>

21:04.880 --> 21:06.610
The world...

21:07.990 --> 21:09.070
is ending.

21:10.960 --> 21:13.860
Not on my watch!

21:22.960 --> 21:24.300
Fall!

21:24.600 --> 21:26.430
Fall!

21:26.430 --> 21:28.190
Fall!

21:28.480 --> 21:34.100
Fall!

21:59.280 --> 22:00.120
You're joking...

22:01.860 --> 22:03.080
No...

22:04.410 --> 22:05.560
It won't come out.

22:06.200 --> 22:08.370
Do not blame yourself.

22:08.370 --> 22:10.570
This is but our fate.

23:36.010 --> 23:40.020
Next Episode      Episode 61

23:36.010 --> 23:40.020
<i>Twilight Goodbye</i>
